<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>At (230)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>at &lt;room@zone&gt; &lt;command&gt;
at &lt;someone or something&gt; &lt;command&gt;
</pre>
<p>Examples:
</p>
<pre>at temple@udgaard look
at Gnort say Hello there.
</pre>
<p>Does a command as if you stood somewhere else, and brings you straight 
back. Name a room by its symbolic name (room@zone), or anyone or anything 
in the world: then you are where they are. You are back where you were 
afterwards, unless the command took you somewhere else, or your place 
no longer exists.
</p><p>It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Goto</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Transfer</a>
</pre>




</div>